          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "https://api.chainweb.com/chainweb/{apiVersion}/mainnet01/cut",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Publish a cut to a Chainweb node.\n\nThe cut must contain an origin property that is not `null`. The receiving node\nwill first try to obtain all missing dependencies from the node that is\nindicated in by the origin property before searching for the dependencies in the\nP2P network.\n"
